OL,3,GWest Midlands                          
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSkies        
OL,6,Fcontinuing to clear this evening and   
OL,7,Fremaining clear overnight. Quickly     
OL,8,Fturning cold with a widespread and     
OL,9,Flocally sharp frost developing. Patchy 
OL,10,Ffreezing fog developing in the         
OL,11,Fcountryside.                           
OL,13,CSaturday:FA cold and frosty start for  
OL,14,Fmost with any freezing fog gradually   
OL,15,Fclearing through the morning.          
OL,16,FOtherwise a largely sunny albeit       
OL,17,Fchilly day with a freshening easterly  
OL,18,Fbreeze later.                          
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
