OL,3,GWest Midlands                          
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FA       
OL,6,Fcloudier day on Sunday but probably    
OL,7,Fremaining mostly dry. Turning more     
OL,8,Fchangeable into next week with spells  
OL,9,Fof windier and wetter weather. Slowly  
OL,10,Fbecoming a bit milder.                 
